                                        <h3>What is Chai Point's biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Chai QSR + B2B vending + D2C + retail combined + Bengaluru + national expansion. Multi-channel chai + tea leadership.</p>
                                        <h3>Is B2B F&amp;B vending real opportunity?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes — corporate offices + IT companies + factories drive recurring B2B revenue. Chai Point + specialty coffee + wellness beverage vending all growing.</p>
                                        <h3>Can new chai brands compete?</h3>
